---
const { active = false } = Astro.props;
const HeadingTag = active ? 'h1' : 'p';
---
<section class:list={["feature-workflow-panel","dashboard-page"].concat(active ? ['is-active'] : [])} data-feature-panel="MonitorProgress" hidden={!active}>
<section class="dashboard-hero" aria-labelledby="dashboard-title">
    <div class="dashboard-hero-copy">
      <HeadingTag data-feature-heading class="feature-kicker" id="dashboard-title">Artwork workflow dashboard for promo teams</HeadingTag>
      <h2>See every project. <strong>Move the right work forward.</strong></h2>
      <p class="feature-lede">Track every artwork project from creation to production. Business owners always know where work is moving and where it is blocked.</p>
      <div class="feature-actions"><a class="feature-primary-action" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <span>&nearr;</span></a></div>
      <div class="dashboard-hero-states" aria-label="Project stages"><span>Artwork</span><span>Approval</span><span>Revision</span><span>Production</span></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="dashboard-hero-image"><img src="/assets/features/workflow-dashboard/dashboard-hero.png" alt="Operations team reviewing promotional-product project statuses on a large display"><figcaption><b>One live view</b><span>Artwork &rarr; Approval &rarr; Production</span></figcaption></figure>
  </section>

  <section class="ops-problem feature-shell" aria-labelledby="dashboard-problem-title">
    <div><p class="feature-kicker">Replace status chasing</p><h2 id="dashboard-problem-title">A project should surface its blocker before the deadline slips.</h2></div>
    <div class="ops-problem-flow ops-status-flow" aria-label="Scattered updates become one live view"><span>Inbox updates</span><i>+</i><span>Approval follow-ups</span><i>+</i><span>Production checks</span><b>One live workflow view</b></div>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-live feature-shell" id="live-dashboard">
    <header class="dashboard-section-heading"><p class="feature-kicker">Live operational view</p><h2>One view shows what is moving, waiting, and ready.</h2><p>Filter the workflow by stage and focus the team on the projects that need a decision now.</p></header>
    <div class="dashboard-live-layout">
      <div class="dashboard-board">
        <div class="board-top"><b>Artwork workflow</b><span id="board-total">12 active projects</span></div>
        <div class="board-filters" role="tablist" aria-label="Filter project status"><button class="is-active" type="button" data-status="all" role="tab" aria-selected="true">All</button><button type="button" data-status="artwork" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Artwork</button><button type="button" data-status="approval" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Approval</button><button type="button" data-status="revision" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Revisions</button><button type="button" data-status="production" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Production</button></div>
        <div class="board-columns">
          <article data-column="artwork"><header><span></span><b>Pending artwork</b><i>03</i></header><div class="project-card"><small>Northline event</small><b>Bottle campaign</b><span>Artwork due today</span></div><div class="project-card"><small>Spring launch</small><b>Canvas tote</b><span>Source file missing</span></div></article>
          <article data-column="approval"><header><span></span><b>Awaiting approval</b><i>04</i></header><div class="project-card"><small>Retail opening</small><b>Staff hoodie</b><span>Client link opened</span></div><div class="project-card"><small>Conference kit</small><b>Travel mug</b><span>Waiting 1 day</span></div></article>
          <article data-column="revision"><header><span></span><b>Revision requests</b><i>02</i></header><div class="project-card"><small>Member campaign</small><b>Embroidered cap</b><span>Logo size change</span></div><div class="project-card"><small>Summer team</small><b>Performance tee</b><span>Version 3 requested</span></div></article>
          <article data-column="production"><header><span></span><b>Production ready</b><i>03</i></header><div class="project-card"><small>Annual meeting</small><b>Welcome bundle</b><span>PDF generated</span></div><div class="project-card"><small>Client gifting</small><b>Desk set</b><span>Approved today</span></div></article>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="dashboard-insight"><p>Current focus</p><span id="insight-count">12</span><h3 id="insight-title">Every active project</h3><p id="insight-copy">See the complete artwork workload and identify the next decision.</p><div><i></i><small>Live project visibility</small></div></aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dashboard-proof">
    <div class="dashboard-proof-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">From visibility to action</p><h2>Catch the block before it becomes a delay.</h2><p>Instantly identify pending artwork, approval requests, revisions, approved work, and production-ready projects.</p><div class="dashboard-proof-outcome"><small>Customer outcome</small><strong>Increase operational visibility without increasing administrative overhead.</strong></div></div>
    <figure><img src="/assets/features/workflow-dashboard/dashboard-visibility.png" alt="Business owner checking project status while production orders are prepared"><figcaption>One current status, shared from the office to the production floor.</figcaption></figure>
    <div class="dashboard-benefit-list" aria-label="Workflow Progress Dashboard benefits"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Complete operational visibility.</h3><p>See every active project and its current stage.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Faster decision-making.</h3><p>Act on the project that needs attention now.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Better workload management.</h3><p>Balance work across artwork, approvals, and production.</p></div></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>Reduced project delays.</h3><p>Catch blocked work before deadlines slip.</p></div></article></div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-related dashboard-related feature-shell"><div class="feature-section-heading"><div><p class="feature-kicker">Connected workflow</p><h2>Visibility works better when the work stays connected.</h2></div></div><div class="feature-related-grid"><a class="dashboard-related-link" href="/features/centralized-project-workspace"><small>Organize first</small><h3>Centralized Project Workspace</h3><p>Keep every project record together.</p><span>Explore feature &nearr;</span></a><a class="dashboard-related-link" href="/features/team-collaboration"><small>Move together</small><h3>Team Collaboration</h3><p>Give every role the same current information.</p><span>Explore feature &nearr;</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="feature-cta dashboard-cta" id="dashboard-cta">
    <div class="pp-cta-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">See the whole workflow</p><h2>Know what is moving before anyone has to ask.</h2></div><div class="feature-actions"><a class="feature-primary-action" href="/contact">Talk to Sales &nearr;</a></div></section>
</section>
